# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:108
translate fr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_6706efee:

    # "The man I presumed to be Azul hung upside down, his lower jaw broken and hang by the thinnest thread of flesh."
    "L'homme que je présumais être Azul pendait la tête en bas, sa mâchoire inférieure brisée et ne tenant plus que par un mince lambeau de chair."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:109
translate fr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_8f6c41e0:

    # "His eyes were torn out leaving red trails of blood decorating his horrified, pale face."
    "Ses yeux avaient été arrachés, laissant des traînées rouges de sang qui ornaient son visage horrifié et pâle."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:110
translate fr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_0d45b3d7:

    # "His body desecrated, long hooks dug into the flesh pulling back sheets of flesh as a pool of blood circled his body beneath."
    "Son corps profané était percé de longs crochets enfoncés dans la chair, tirant des lambeaux de peau tandis qu'une mare de sang entourait son corps en dessous."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:111
translate fr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_661276f1:

    # "In his exposed ribcage, a crude cage was formed with sharp metal shards, inside a black crow cried as it pecked at his insides angrily."
