# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:156
translate fr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_4532cba5:

    # "Perhaps they were enchanted, but they seemed sharper and able to cut at my flesh unlike any other."
    "Peut-être étaient-elles enchantées, mais elles semblaient plus tranchantes et capables de couper ma chair comme aucune autre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:157
translate fr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_b7befe8a:

    # "I managed to strike it with my tail, piercing a gaping hole through its chest."
    "Je parvins à le frapper avec ma queue, perçant un trou béant dans sa poitrine."

