translate fr qst_bloodhound_3_toBasement_1c0b9dcc:

    # "But instead of turning limp, it slashed down, causing a painful wound in my tail as it continued on despite its horrific injury."
    "Mais au lieu de s'effondrer, il abattit sa lame, infligeant une blessure douloureuse à ma queue tout en continuant malgré sa blessure atroce."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheBloodhound/scr_3.rpy:159
